    "court": {
        "_doc": "systems/court.js — courtiers not of the blood. Seats: baseSeats + Prestige / prestigePerSeat + title rank × seatsPerTitleRank (+ rulerSeats on a throne), at most maxSeats. An invitation's odds: baseChance + friendship × scoreWeight + (their loyalty − 50) × loyaltyWeight + Prestige × prestigeWeight (capped) + rank + the stipend against what they think fair (occupationStipend, × greedyStipend / ambitiousStipend) + traitChance; a refusal holds for refuseCooldown days unless you offer more. Joining costs a welcome purse of joinDays × the stipend (paid into their purse). Loyalty settles weekly (cadence) by `drift` toward baseLoyalty + Prestige + stipend + friendship + office + traitLoyalty; an ambitious courtier without an office for passedOverDays sours. Each unpaid day costs unpaidLoyalty; unpaidLeaveDays unpaid and they go. An officer below embezzleBelow skims; below leaveBelow they may leave (leaveChance a week), below offerBelow a better offer may lure them (offerChance). Skills (0..skillCap): occupationSkills + traitSkills + a hashed jitter in [jitterMin, jitterMax], +1 leadership from age 35.",
        "baseSeats": 2, "prestigePerSeat": 40, "seatsPerTitleRank": 1, "rulerSeats": 3, "maxSeats": 12,
        "minAge": 16, "minScore": 0, "refuseCooldown": 30, "joinDays": 7,
